		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "64d07997-4b8e-4f81-9aa3-796356ab4757")
		(at 126 98)
		(descr "Bourns PEC11R-4xxxF-Sxxxx 12 mm incremental encoder, vertical shaft, with push switch (an N-type, no push, fits with S1/S2 empty). Origin = shaft centre. A-C-B on 2.5 mm at y +7.5, push S1/S2 on 5.0 mm at y -7.0, mounting lugs in 1.0 x 3.0 mm slots at x +-6.45. Positions read from the daxxn PEC11R-4230F-S0024 model (terminals at x -2.54/0/+2.54, lugs 0.2 x 2.5 at x -6.6 / +6.35) and rounded to the Bourns 2.5 / 5.0 mm grid - confirm against the Bourns drawing and on the part (F11). A on the left seen from the shaft side with the terminals toward you - confirm (a swap only reverses the count, firmware). 3D via RX7_MODELS (30 mm shaft model for the 20 mm 4220F)")
